# Route @nimoh-digital-solutions scoped packages to GitHub Packages registry.
# All other packages continue to resolve from the default npm registry.
# Auth token is NOT stored here — Yarn v1 cannot interpolate ${ENV_VAR} in .npmrc.
# In CI, the token is written to ~/.npmrc by the workflow before publish.
@nimoh-digital-solutions:registry=https://npm.pkg.github.com
